IMPORTANCE OF STATISTICS
Importance of Statistics to the Government
The role of government has increased and requires
much greater information in the form of numerical
figures, to fulfill the welfare objectives in addition to
the efficient running of their administration.
Popular statistical methods such as time-series
analysis index numbers forecasting and demand
analysis are extensively used in tormulating economic
policies.
In a democratic country like India, various political
groups are also guided by the statistical analysis
regarding their popularity in the masses.
