Statistics can be Misused - Statistics can be misused by
ignorant or wrongly motivated persons. Any person can
misuse statistics and draw any type of conclusion he
likes.
Statistical results are true only on average - Statistical
results are true on an average as the results are affected
by a large number of causes. In other words, statistical
laws are not universally true.
